# The merge gate in detail (docs/guide/how-merge-gate.md).
title: The base branch's gate verifies the pull request head in a sandbox, a model from another family reviews it, and ship needs both green
direction: down
pr: Pull request opened or updated
wf: Gate workflow from the base branch
gate: aayudha/merge-gate: verify in a sandbox
art: aayudha-pack run artifact
insp: aayudha/inspect: merge, fix, or rebuild
pack: aayudha/pack: ledger write with a bot App
ship: ship: both checks green, pack verifies
pr -> gate: head commit
wf -> gate: trusted steps
gate -> art: pack.json
art -> insp: pack and diff
art -> pack
insp -> ship: verdict
pack -> ship: authoritative pack
